1. Added a mock Dialog component that simply renders its children in a div
2. Created a mock for the @calcom/ui module
3. Added error boundary using try-catch to handle any potential rendering errors
4. Kept the original component functionality intact while providing fallbacks for the missing dependencies

This should resolve the missing Dialog component error while allowing the preview to function. The mock Dialog component provides a simple fallback that won't break the rendering flow.

